 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "matrix is a non-empty rectangular list of integer rows and commands a list of strings. \"reverseRow r\" reverses the order of the values in row r; \"swap r1 r2\" exchanges rows r1 and r2 (r1 may equal r2). Indices are 0-based and valid. Apply the commands in order and return the resulting matrix as a new list of rows.",
